  "title": "OpenReplay Spots get stuck with \"You’re viewing the original recording. Processed Spot will be available here shortly.\"",
  "summary": "I have recently setup a self-hosted OpenReplay server on AWS following the guide on the docs page: Deploy to AWS - OpenReplay Documentation . I am using this for the OpenReplay Spots feature so we can record sessions for our application without changing the code (future plan). Sometimes when I record a session with the OpenReplay Spot extension (on Brave browser), I get stuck on the following message: “You’re viewing the original recording. Processed Spot will be available here shortly”. This ...",
